AAO ABBAS MADAD KARNE KO AAO BHAYYA<br>
<br>
GIRTE HI QAKH PA GHOODE SE HUSSAIN IBNE ALI<br>
ARSH TARRANE LAGA AUR ZAMI HILNE LAGI<br>
ZAQMI HATHOUN SE KAMAR THAM KE FARZANDE NABI<br>
HAYE DARYA KI TARAF DEKH KE KHETE THE YAHI AAO<br>
ABBAS MADAD KARNE KO AAO BHAYYA<br>
TANHA MAQTAL ME HOON FOUJHO KO HATAO BHAYYA<br>
<br>
Tum Ko Akber Ke Janaze Pe Bahut Yaad Kiya<br>
Aur Asghar Ke Bhi Lashe Pe Bahut Yaad Kiya<br>
Bin Tumhare Mai jeeyu Kaise Batao Bhayya<br>
<br>
Teri Furqat Me Mere Qalb-o-Jigar Zaqmi Hai<br>
Pau Zaqmi Hai Kamar Zaqmi Hai Sar Zaqmi Hai<br>
Garm Rheti Se Muhje Aake Uthao Bhayya<br>
<br>
Tum Nahi Ho Tho Mujhe Khoon Rulate Hai Aadu<br>
Zaqm Jis-Jaa Hai Wahi Teq Lagate Hai Aadu<br>
Zalimo Se Mujhe Ab Aake Chudao Bhayya<br>
<br>
Dene Taklif Mujhe Dushamn-e-Deen Bhaitha Hai<br>
Zaqmi Seene Pa Mere Shirm-e-Laien Bhaitha Hai<br>
Aake Seene Se Sitamgar Ko Hatao Bhayya<br>
<br>
Apne Zaanu Se Mera Seena Dabata Hai Laien<br>
Qundh Qanjar Meri Gardan Pa Chalata Hai Laien<br>
Zibha Hota HU Mai Ab Aake Bachao Bahyya<br>
<br>
Do-Jahan Larza Hai Parvaz Ye Wo Manzil Hai<br>
Kya Likha Jaye Ke Aage Ka Bayan Mushkil Hai<br>
Wqat –e-Aqir bhi Labe Shahe Pe Tha Aao Abbas